msgid "Tribal Warrior Recruit"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Tribal Warrior Recruit" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the tribal guard has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of emergency."
"  As far as you can tell, the elders abandoned you in this hellhole when you "
"missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""

